$$
W
  ====
  - [[Page~212 #8: 刮(8)]]
    ==
    - To pare or scrape off, to abrade, to rub or rasp;
    - to burnish;
    - to even off grain;
    - to raze;
    - to extort;
    - _kw(a/)t(8) s(e/)uk(8)_
        [[gwaat3 soek3]]
        to scrape;
        _met._ to oppress;
        to cheapen;
    - _kw(a/)t(8) (1)ts(e/)ung_
        [[gwaat3 zoeng1]],
        to stiffen cloth;
    - _kw(a/)t(8) (4)p(')ing_
        [[gwaat3 ping4]],
        to even (grain);
    - _(2)tau kw(a/)t(8)_
        [[dau2 gwaat3]]
        a striker;
    - _kw(a/)t(8) (4)p(')ing t(i/)(6) (1)fong_
        [[gwaat3 ping4 dei6 fong1]],
        to destroy a place;
    - _kw(a/)t(8) muk(9) (1)s(e/)ung (1)hon_
        [[gwaat3 muk6 soeng1 hon1]],
        to rub one's eyes and to treat well---\
        spoken of another's sudden prosperity;
    - _l(i/)(6) kw(a/)t(8)_
        [[lei6 gwaat3]]
        a tongue-scraper.
    ==
    --
    _Kw(a/)t(8)_ [[gwaat3]] is used in Canton for a _quarter_,
    in imitation of the English sound.
    --
  ====
